Package: dsNoLimitsClient
Title: 'DataSHIELD' Client-Side Nonlinear Mixed-Effects Analysis
Version: 0.0.5.9000
Date: 2026-08-25
Authors@R:
    person("Manuel", "Huth", , "manuel.huth@uni-bonn.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 'DataSHIELD' 'client-side' functions that fit nonlinear
    mixed-effects models to longitudinal data held on several 'server-side'
    nodes by driving a federated optimisation over per-site marginal
    log-likelihoods and gradients, giving estimates and Wald standard errors
    identical to a pooled analysis without any individual-level data leaving
    the servers.
